age.\n\nAutoKit – Automatically selects or uses kits.\n\nBedESP – Highlights beds and displays related information.\n\nKitESP – Displays kit information for players.\n\nNameTags – Displays enhanced player name information.\n\nStorageESP – Highlights storage containers.\n\nBedPlates – Displays information around beds.\n\nBreaker – Automates interactions with beds, lucky blocks, and iron ore.\n\nCrosshair – Adds a customizable crosshair.\n\nDamage Indicator – Displays damage information.\n\nKill Effects – Adds visual effects when eliminating players.\n\nHit Color – Changes hit-related visual effects.\n\nReach Display – Displays attack reach information.\n\nViewmodel – Customizes the first-person viewmodel.\n\nWinEffect – Adds visual effects after winning.\n\nFPS Boost – Reduces visual effects to improve performance.\n\nAutoToxic – Automates supported chat interactions.\n\nAutoGG – Automatically sends a GG message.\n\nAutoVoidDrop – Automates dropping items into the void.\n\nMissileTP – Provides missile-based teleport functionality.\n\nRavenTP – Provides Raven teleport functionality.\n\nTrapDisabler – Disables supported traps.\n\nAnti-AFK – Prevents automatic AFK removal.\n\nAutoSuffocate – Automates supported suffocation interactions.\n\nBedProtector – Automates supported bed protection actions.\n\nStaffDetector – Detects potential staff members.\n\nUI Cleanup – Removes selected interface elements.\n\nSoundChanger – Changes supported game sounds.\n\nSong Beats – Adds music beat effects.\n\nSchematica – Provides schematic building assistance.\n\nGive Btools – Provides building tools.\n\nRejoin – Reconnects to the current server.\n\nServer Hop – Joins another server.\n\nPlayer Teleport – Teleports to selected players.","tags":["bed wars script","free bedwars script","bedwars","anti void","auto farm script"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://flowauth.net/v1/ui/a87f00d9adf63658655fcd02ab86a4ef.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"696ff36b3593559f36ddb741","username":"snow